  "description": "Standard implementation for the Codeer.LowCode.Blazor Designer: project templates, tool menus (DDL generation, DB import, class generation, Excel cheat sheet, Selenium page objects), and an AI chat assistant (model-swappable via Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient). Register everything with one call or pick features individually.",
